# Files (new)

Purpose: the stuff attached to work — contracts on a deal, CVs on a
candidate, any number of uploads per instance. Exists because today
binary context lives in Drive/email and the instance only describes
it; files-on-instance makes the record complete.

| Option | Category | Values / default | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| size / position | layout | x,y,w,h (default 6x4) | |
| variant | layout | gallery (thumbs) / list (rows) | |
| thumb size | layout | s / m / l | gallery |
| title | display | text | |
| icon | display | icon name / none | |
| scope | data | instance / concept / org | concept = recent uploads across instances |
| upload | display | drop-zone on / off | off = read-only browse |
| preview | display | inline (img/pdf) / download only | |
| group by | display | none / type / date / instance | |
| sort | display | newest / name / size | |
| limit | display | none / n | |
| file type | filter | all / image / doc / pdf / other | |
| uploader | filter | any / member[] | |
| parent conditions | filter | SidebarCondition[] | files whose instance matches |
